+      "fill": "Authors must supply, without substituting a different artifact, the model family, artifact path or URI, filename, repository revision, checkpoint or training-step identifier, dtype, and verification digest for each applicable Fast-WAM and Optional `idm` checkpoint; define exact-match comparison and halt before branching when any required identity is absent or mismatched.",
+      "severity": "open"
+    },
+    {
+      "step_id": "S1",
+      "hole": "The replay manifest has no declared CPU thread/process limits or accelerator-memory identity, so the 80GB-class versus A100-40GB execution boundary is not reproducible.",
