+      "severity": "open"
+    },
+    {
+      "step_id": "S2",
+      "hole": "The chosen low-bit operator is not identified for weights or activations, including bit width, quantizer parameters, granularity, calibration scope, and whether the branch uses fake quantization or a real low-bit kernel.",
+      "fill": "Authors must choose and register the W/A operator contract: bit width `b_lo`, signedness, rounding, clipping, scale/zero-point or equivalent, per-tensor/channel/group granularity, activation observer data, and execution mode. Mark fake quantization as graph-level emulation; if a real kernel is claimed, record its backend/version and verify that the intervened path actually executes it. Do not treat the two modes as interchangeable.",
+      "severity": "open"
+    },
+    {
