+      "fill": "Authors must define the exact denominator and valid mask for the action-chunk term, the pixel/channel normalization and observation preprocessing for the image term, and the fixed relative weighting or unit-alignment rule; no value may be inferred from the sum notation.",
+      "severity": "open"
+    },
