+      "step_id": "S3",
+      "hole": "The method does not say how per-state paired measurements become one sitewise `C_r` used for ranking or state-subset correlation.",
+      "fill": "Authors must choose whether to aggregate per-state terms before or after normalization, name the statistic and contact/noncontact pooling rule, and define missing-state handling; record both per-state rows and the resulting sitewise registry.",
