+      "hole": "The permutation test and the oracle simulator-state branch have no reproducible randomization, replacement point, or acceptance definition.",
+      "fill": "Authors must specify the permutation seed and number or complete list of permutations, preserve the score multiset and all other schedule rules, and define exactly which simulator-state quantity the oracle supplies and what comparison it controls; record the oracle branch as a labeled control, not as a replacement for the real association.",
+      "severity": "open"
